/// If the expression is evaluated successfully, an [InstanceRef] reference
/// will be returned.
///
/// If `isolateId` refers to an isolate which has exited, then the `Collected`
/// [Sentinel] is returned.
///
/// The return value can be one of [InstanceRef] or [ErrorRef].
///
/// This method will throw a [SentinelException] in the case a [Sentinel] is
/// returned.␀␀␀À␀qÀ␀qÀ␀q!␀␀␀À␀q7À␀q7À␀q=␀␀␀À␀qDÀ␀qDÀ␀qJ␀␀À␀n5À␀n5ƒÈÀ␀q‚—/// The `getAllocationProfile` RPC is used to retrieve allocation information
